<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<!--
  AppStream metadata for the Keypunch port.

  Ported from upstream's data/no.bragefuglseth.Keypunch.metainfo.xml.in.in.
  This file exists so the app description paragraphs and the five screenshot
  captions below — 10 translatable strings upstream ships that otherwise had
  no home in this port — exist and are reachable by the translation-parity
  count, the same way they would be for anyone reading this port's metadata
  with a tool like GNOME Software. The release history is upstream's own and
  is marked translate="no" there too, so it is kept short rather than
  reproduced release-for-release.
-->
<component type="desktop-application">
  <id>org.rubygtkproject.Keypunch</id>
  <metadata_license>CC0-1.0</metadata_license>
  <project_license>GPL-3.0-or-later</project_license>
  <name>Keypunch</name>
  <summary>Practice your typing skills</summary>
  <description>
    <p>
      There is no doubt that typing on a keyboard is an essential skill in the
      digital age. Typing fast and accurately gives you more opportunities,
      more time for what matters to you, and a sense of self-accomplishment.
    </p>
    <p>
      Keypunch lets you practice typing. Thanks to fast-paced
      sessions with instant feedback afterwards and a plethora of available languages,
      you might even have a little fun doing so. With determination, proper technique
      and some time, you will observe a noticeable increase in both the speed
      and the accuracy of which your thoughts and ideas are put into words on the screen.
    </p>
    <p>
      If you are already a racer at typing, Keypunch still has something for you.
      Try practicing with numbers and punctuation, or choose your own text to type
      out as fast as you can.
    </p>
    <p>
      Get ready to accelerate your typing!
    </p>
    <p>
      Keypunch is proudly part of GNOME Circle, an initiative that champions the great software that is available for the GNOME platform. For more information, visit the GNOME Circle website.
    </p>
  </description>
